Monolayer Boron Nitride - MF/scf
================================

In this directory we perform a standard SCF calculation and obtain a charge
density which will be used to generate all the other WFNs. We don't have to
worry about k-grids at this point, we just use a k-grid that converges the
total SCF energy.

To perform the calculation, just launch ``./01-calculate_scf.qsub``. This
calculation should run in 4 mins. Take a look at the input and output, and
try to understand what happened. Visualize the structure written to
``static/geometry.xsf`` with VESTA or XCrySDen. What is the primitive unit cell?
